---

WHY THIS FILE EXISTS

Until 2026-08-11 this repository carried no LICENSE at all. An absent license is
already all-rights-reserved by default, so this file changes nothing about what is
granted — it makes the existing posture LEGIBLE. Without it, no recipient,
contributor, or downstream consumer could tell what they were permitted to do.

THIS IS NOT AN OPEN-SOURCE DECISION

Stating the current posture deliberately does not prejudge whether any part of this
work is opened later. That question is tracked separately:

  Openness is a decision for when this ships. The construction pipeline —
  subject → curriculum → rubric-shaped scaffold → AI-filled tutorial →
  auto-authored checks — has no OSS competitor of substance, so the choice has
  real commercial consequences and is better made against a shipped product.

The asymmetry is the reason for this order: declaring proprietary terms is
reversible — you can always open later — whereas publishing under an open license
cannot be undone.
